        "subject": "🔍 Review Needed: Low Confidence Document Extraction",
        "emailType": "html",
        "message": "<h2>Document Review Required</h2>\n<p>A document was processed with a <strong>low confidence score</strong> and requires manual review.</p>\n\n<h3>Extraction Details:</h3>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; max-width: 600px;\">\n  <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Category</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.extracted.category }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Vendor</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.extracted.vendor_name || 'Not detected' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr style=\"background-color: #f2f2f2;\">\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Date</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.extracted.document_date || 'Not detected' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Amount</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.extracted.total_amount || 'Not detected' }} {{ $json.extracted.currency }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr style=\"background-color: #ffcccc;\">\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\"><strong>Confidence Score</strong></td>\n    <td style=\"padding: 10px; border: 1px solid #ddd;\">{{ $json.extracted.confidence_score }} (Threshold: {{ $('Set Config').item.json.confidenceThreshold }})</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<h3>Original Email:</h3>\n<ul>\n  <li><strong>From:</strong> {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.from.text }}</li>\n  <li><strong>Subject:</strong> {{ $('Gmail Trigger').item.json.subject }}</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p style=\"color: #666; font-size: 12px;\">This is an automated notification from your Vision AI Document Processing Bot.</p>",
        "options": {}
